{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ v_2.len = 2
>>
Rule 20 (primitive type variable should not be zero)
{v_1 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≠ 0
